'''Ancient Mountains''' (はえぬき三連山, ''Haenuki San Renzan'', '''Three Original Mountains''') is the 18th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 67th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is a remake of [[Alcatraz]]. Its stages are fairly easy with the exception of the 5th stage.
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

